{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":69,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祈求上帝拯救的禱告"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛作的詩，交給樂長，調用「百合花」。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，求你拯救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為洪水快把我淹沒；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我深陷泥沼，無法站穩腳；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我落入深淵，被洪流淹沒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我連連呼救，已聲嘶力竭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我期盼上帝的幫助，望眼欲穿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無故恨我的人不計其數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無故害我的仇敵勢力強大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逼我償還我沒有偷過的東西。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，你知道我的愚昧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的罪惡也瞞不過你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主——萬軍之耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要使等候你的人因我而受辱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要讓尋求你的人因我而蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為了你的緣故遭受辱罵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱滿面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的弟兄視我為陌生人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的手足看我為外人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為你的殿心急如焚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"辱罵你之人的辱罵都落在我身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我悲傷禁食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就羞辱我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我披上麻衣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就譏笑我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我成了街談巷議的話題，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醉漢作歌取笑我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"可是，耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你悅納人的時候，我向你禱告。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你以你的大愛和信實的拯救應允我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你救我脫離泥沼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓我沉下去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你救我脫離恨我的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我離開深淵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要讓洪水淹沒我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓深淵吞滅我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓墳墓吞噬我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你答應我的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你的慈愛充滿良善；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你以豐盛的憐憫眷顧我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要掩面不理你的僕人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我正身陷困境，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你快快答應我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你前來拯救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因仇敵環伺而救贖我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你知道我受的辱罵、欺凌和羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仇敵都在你面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的辱罵使我心碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令我絕望無助。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我渴望有人同情，卻沒有一個；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"期望有人安慰，卻無一人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們給我苦膽當食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又拿醋給我解渴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"願他們面前的宴席變為網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為他們的報應和陷阱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們眼目昏暗，無法看見；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們顫顫巍巍，直不起腰來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你向他們傾倒烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你的怒火淹沒他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們的家園一片荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們的帳篷無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們迫害你擊打過的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嘲笑你所打傷之人的痛苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你清算他們的種種罪行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓他們得享你的拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們從生命冊上被抹去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不得和義人的名字同列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，我陷入痛苦和憂傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你的救恩保護我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用歌聲讚美上帝的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以感恩的心尊崇祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這要比獻上公牛，獻上有蹄有角的公牛更討耶和華喜悅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卑微的人看見這一切就歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你們尋求上帝的人心神振奮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華垂聽窮苦人的祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不輕看祂被囚的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願天地都讚美祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願海和其中的一切都讚美祂！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝必拯救錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建猶大的城邑。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的子民要住在那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擁有那片土地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂僕人的後裔要承受那地方為業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡愛祂名的人都要住在那裡。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/69.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/70.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/68.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":36}